{"severity":"error","file":"errors/io_not_allowed_2.march","start_line":10,"start_col":2,"end_line":13,"end_col":5,"message":"`counter_migrate_state` migrates actor `Counter`'s state, and `migrate_state` must be IO-free, but it calls capabilities that need `IO.Console`.\nA state migration runs during the hot-migration window, before user messages.","code":"io_not_allowed","fix":null,"labels":[],"notes":["Move the side effects into a handler of `Counter`, which runs after the migration completes."],"category":"CAPABILITY"}
